Brute Force Approach:

class Solution {
    public int pivotIndex(int[] nums) {
        for(int i=0;i<nums.length;i++){
            int leftSum=0;
            int rightSum=0;
            for(int j=0;j<i;j++){
                leftSum+=nums[j];
            }
            for(int k=i+1;k<nums.length;k++){
                rightSum+=nums[k];
            }
            if(leftSum==rightSum){
                return i;
            }
        }
        return -1;
        
    }
}
Time Complexity: O(n²)
Space Complexity: O(1)

Optimal Approach:
class Solution {
    public int pivotIndex(int[] nums) {
        int totalSum=0;
        for(int num : nums){
            totalSum+=num;
        }
        int leftSum=0;
        for(int i=0;i<nums.length;i++){
            int rightSum=totalSum-leftSum-nums[i];
            if(leftSum==rightSum){
                return i;
            }
            leftSum+=nums[i];
        }
        return -1;
        
    }
}
Time complexity: O(n)
Space complexity: O(1)
